  "historyNote": "#7618, eff 12-28-01; ss by #8319, EMERGENCY, eff 4-5-05; ss by #8342, eff 4-28-05; ss by #8649, eff 6-2-06; ss by #10507, eff 1-21-14, EXPIRED: 1-21-24; renumbered by #13535, INTERIM (formerly Saf-C 1401.122) New. #14011, INTERIM, eff 6-27-24; ss by #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (formerly Saf-C 1401.17) (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
